---
const supportEmail = 'hello@pixelarclabs.com';
---

<section id="support" class="border-t border-border/40 bg-bg-elevated/50">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-24 sm:py-28">
    <h2 class="text-sm font-medium tracking-wide text-accent uppercase">Support</h2>

    <p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-muted">
      Need help with a Pixel Arc Labs app? We're here. This page is the official support
      contact for all of our applications on the App Store.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-bg-muted p-8">
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted">Reach us at</p>
      <a
        href={`mailto:${supportEmail}`}
        class="mt-2 inline-block text-2xl font-semibold text-text transition-colors hover:text-accent focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-bg-muted rounded-sm"
      >
        {supportEmail}
      </a>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-muted">
        We typically respond within one business day. Please include the app name and a
        brief description of your question so we can help you faster.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
